A 15%, A2 15%, R 4%; R reads GAIN 52%, MIXED 27%, FLAT 13%, HARM 1%; the batch NOT DISCRIMINATING 5%, NOT MEASURED
2%. Before anything is run: R ships from this batch 44%.

Gates before the first scored call, as before (a failed gate is fixed and re-run and spends nothing scored): W0 the
